msgstr "https://github.com/djm56/msc-post-expiry"

#. Description of the plugin
#: msc-post-expiry.php
msgid ""
"Automatically expire posts and pages on a scheduled date. Set expiration "
"dates in the post editor and let the plugin handle the rest."
msgstr ""
"Expirar automaticamente posts e páginas em uma data programada. Defina datas"
" de expiração no editor de posts e deixe o plugin cuidar do resto."

#. Author of the plugin
#: msc-post-expiry.php
msgid "Anomalous Developers"
msgstr "Anomalous Developers"

